$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of compounds (IV) and (XVIII). LiAlН4 (467.4 mg, 12.3 mmol) was
added to the solution of compound (III) or (XVII) (1 mmol) in anhydrous
tetrahydrofuran with intensive stirring. The reaction mixture was boiled
for 3 h and diluted with water (3 mL). The precipitate of Al(OH)3 was
filtered off, and the water layer was washed with chloroform (3 × 60mL),
dried over СаСl2 , and evaporated in vacuum. The residue was fractionated
on a column with SiО2 that was subsequently eluted with chloroform and
methanol. 3β
-Hydroxy-28-oxo-28-{6-[bis(3-aminopropyl)amino]hexylamino}lup-20(29)-ene
(IV). The yield of compound (IV) 0.49 g (74%). Rf0.13; mp 250-252°С. [α]D
20 +9°(с CH3 ОН); 1H NMR (CD3OD): 0.86, 0.92, 0.96, 1.04, 1.13 (15 H, 5s
CH3), 1.18-2.03 (38 H, CH2, CH3, H2', H3', H4', H5', H8', H11', 2 NH2 ),
1.69 (3 H, s, H30), 2.18-2.48 (5 H, mH13, H16, H6'), 2.46-2.67 (4 H, m
H7', H10'), 3.05-3.28 (2 H, m, H19, H3), 3.31-3.48 (6 H, m, H1', H9',
H12'), 4.62 and 4.78 (2 H, both broadened s, H29), 5.52-5.73 (1 H, m,
CONH); 13C NMR (CD3OD): 14.4, 15.4, 17.6, 19.3, 20.1, 21.8, 22.9, 23.6,
25.4 (C3'), 25.6, 28.9 (C5'), 29.2 (C2'), 29.9 (C4'), 30.1, 30.3, 30.7,
32.3, 32.7, 33.5, 34.2 (C8', C11'), 35.2, 36.7, 37.3, 37.7, 38.3, 39.2
(C9'), 39.2 (C12'), 40.5, 42.6, 46.4 (C1'), 46.5, 48.1, 49.7 (C7', C10'),
51.1, 51.7 (C6'), 55.7, 77.3 (C3), 109.8 (C29), 150.7 (C20), 176.8 (C28).
Found, %: C 74.82, H 11.26, N 7.94. Calc. for C42H78N4O2 (M671.013), %: C
75.37, H 11.71, N 8.35.
