$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of compounds (IV) and (XVIII).
LiAlН4 (467.4 mg, 12.3 mmol) was added to the solution of compound (III)
or (XVII) (1 mmol) in anhydrous tetrahydrofuran with intensive stirring.
The reaction mixture was boiled for 3 h and diluted with water (3 mL).
The precipitate of Al(OH)3 was filtered off, and the water layer was
washed with chloroform (3 × 60mL), dried over СаСl2 , and evaporated in
vacuum. The residue was fractionated on a column with SiО2 that was
subsequently eluted with chloroform and methanol. 3β
-Hydroxy-28-oxo-28-[(3-aminopropyl)-4-aminophenylsulfonyl-4-phenylamino]lup-20(29)-ene
(XIV) was prepared from compound (XIII) as described for compound (IV).
The yield of compound (XIV) 0.53 g (72%). Rf 0.19; mp 196°С. [α]D 20
-8°(с CH3 ОН); 1H NMR (CD3OD): 0.81, 0.94, 0.97, 0.98, 1.02 (15 H, 5s,
CH3), 1.21-2.00 (26 H, CH2, CH, H2'', NH2 , NH), 1.69 (3 H, s, H30),
2.47-2.74 (5 H, m, H13, H16, H3''), 2.98-3.20 (1 H, m, H19), 3.60- 3.75
(2 H, m, H1''), 4.54 and 4.67 (1 H, both broade- ned s, H29), 6.52-6.63
(1 H, m, CONH), 6.40-6.58 (2 H, m, H9', H10'), 7.52-7.98 (6 H, m, H2',
H3', H5', H6', H8', H11'); 13C NMR (CD3OD): 11.7, 14.7, 16.1, 19.5, 20.0,
21.2, 21.9, 26.0, 26.8, 29.1 (C2''), 30.0, 31.1, 33.7, 34.0, 34.5, 37.3,
37.9, 38.1, 40.0, 41.1, 42.4 (C3''), 43.0, 46.0 (C1''), 46.8, 47.6, 50.3,
50.5, 55.3, 57.2, 78.4 (C3), 109.8 (C20), 114.6 (C2'), 114.7 (C9'), 120.2
(C6', C10'), 128.6 (C8'), 128.9 (C11'), 129.0 (C3'), 130.1 (C5'), 136.1
(C7'), 137.2 (C4'), 143.4 (C1'), 151.2 (C29), 151.6 (C12'), 175.7 (C28).
Found, %: C 72.46, H 8.11, N 5.21, S 3.87. Calc. for C45H63N3O4S
(M742.069), %: C 72.84, H 8.56, N 5.66, S 4.32.
