$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of compounds (IV) and (XVIII).
LiAlН4 (467.4 mg, 12.3 mmol) was added to the solution of compound (III)
or (XVII) (1 mmol) in anhydrous tetrahydrofuran with intensive stirring.
The reaction mixture was boiled for 3 h and diluted with water (3 mL).
The precipitate of Al(OH)3 was filtered off, and the water layer was
washed with chloroform (3 × 60mL), dried over СаСl2, and evaporated in
vacuum. The residue was fractionated on a column with SiО2 that was
subsequently eluted with chloroform and methanol. 3β
-Acetoxy-28-oxo-28-[3-acetyl-(3-aminopropyl)- amino]lup-20(29)-ene
(VIII). Compound (VIII) was prepared from compound (VI) similarly to
compound (IV). Further, the reaction mixture was boiled for 8 h with
acetic anhydride (1.3 mL) and poured into 5% solution of HCl (100 mL).
The precipitate was filtered, washed with water, dried, and
recrystallized from ethanol. Yield 0.42 g, 70%. Rf0.34; mp 128-130°С.
[α]D 20 +11°(с CHСl3); 1H NMR: 0.86, 0.92, 0.96, 1.04, 1.13 (15 H, 5s,
CH3), 1.18-2.03 (25 H, CH2, CH, H2', NH), 1.69 (3 H, s, H30), 2.08 and
2.31 (6 H, 2s, 2 Ac), 2.18-2.71 (3 H, m, H13, H16), 3.23-3.53 (5 H, m,
H19, H3', H1'), 4.42-4.45 (1 H, m, H3), 4.62 and 4.78 (2 H, both
broadened s, H29); 13C NMR: 14.2, 15.3, 17.4, 18.6, 19.3, 20.0, 21.6,
22.8, 25.4, 29.8, 30.1, 30.4, 32.2, 32.6, 33.5, 34.3 (C2'), 36.6, 37.0,
37.3, 38.0, 39.7 (C3'), 40.4, 42.5, 43.4 (C1'), 45.7, 46.2, 46.5, 47.8,
50.9, 51.4, 55.4, 80.8 (C3), 109.4 (C29), 150.2 (C20), 170.4 (CH3CO),
172.4 (NHСОСН, 178.4(C28). Found, %: C 74.07, H 9.85, N 4.26. Calc. for
C37H60N2O2 (M569.912), %: C 74.45, H 10.13, N 4.69.
